bxc5 { We reach a critical position as White needs to find a plan to create queenside threats. } 17. Qa4 ( { A healthier option was } 17. Rb1 { and if Black attempts to continue as he did in the game with } Nf7 18. Qc2 Bh6 { then White could reply } 19. exf5 $5 gxf5 20. Bd3 Bg5 21. Bxg5 Nxg5 22. f4 $1 { ⩲ with a comfortable position. } ) 
